1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,014
Tracks silent after Setup
Tracks? The Console tab says why.

2
00:00:06,214 --> 00:00:12,943
"Sforzando isn't in REAPER's plugin list":
install Sforzando, then rescan plug-ins.

3
00:00:13,143 --> 00:00:17,871
Options > Preferences >
Plug-ins > VST, then "Re-scan".

4
00:00:20,071 --> 00:00:26,086
Only Sforzando's VST or VST3 plug-in
works. AU and CLAP aren't supported.

5
00:00:26,286 --> 00:00:33,086
"The Arachno SoundFont isn't downloaded":
re-run the installer, answer y to Arachno.

6
00:00:35,286 --> 00:00:38,086
Then run Setup Tracks again.

7
00:00:38,286 --> 00:00:44,657
Each track should have a Sforzando instance
with an Arachno instrument loaded.
